==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|es|annuli}}

# A [[ring]]- or [[donut]]-shaped [[area]] or [[structure]].
# {{context|geometry|lang=en}} The [[region]] in a [[plane]] between two concentric [[circle]]s of different [[radius]].
# {{context|topology|lang=en}} Any [[topological space]] [[homeomorphic]] to the region in a plane between two concentric circles of different radius.
# {{context|astronomy|lang=en}} The ring of the [[sun]] not covered by the [[moon]] in an [[annular eclipse|annular solar eclipse]].
# {{context|botany|lang=en}} Structure in a [[fern]] that consists of differentially thick-walled [[cell]]s on a [[sporangium]] that bend and [[distort]] as a result of drying.
# {{context|mycology|lang=en}} The membranous remnants of a [[partial veil]] which leaves a ring on the stem of a mushroom.
# {{context|oil and gas production|lang=en}} The space contained between the centre well bore and any external tubing. Sometimes used for separated gas flow.

